 <COL N="0064B"></COL> major sexagenario.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Eus. a pr.</HI></P> <P COM="0064">140 ( <HI REND="ITALIC">In marg.</HI>  Antoninus ann. XXV, mens. III.)—Antoninus,
