 <COL N="0062B"></COL> et quartum a B. Petro fuisse.</HI>  Eus. a. 100.</P> <P COM="0062">103  <HI REND="ITALIC">Evaristus papa IV, sedit annis</HI>  VIII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">passus</HI>  VI,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Kal. Nov. Trajanus,</HI>  etc., ut Aug.</P> <P COM="0062"><COL N="0062C"></COL> 105  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hoc tempore Simeon Cleophae filius Hierosolymis
episcopus crucifigitur,</HI> <NOTE N="(21*)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0062" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0062D"></COL> Pagius in critica Baronii, an. 107, Simeonis
martyrium ad an. 116 referendum censet.</NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">pro quo Justus ordinatur</HI> 
Eus. a. 107.— <HI REND="ITALIC">Ignatius Antiochiae episcopus
clarus doctor habetur.</HI></P> <P COM="0062">107  <HI REND="ITALIC">Terraemotus magnus. Adhuc floruit Polycarpus
Smyrnae episcopus, apostolorum discipulus.</HI></P> <P COM="0062">108  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hoc tempore Plinius secundus philosophus clarus
pro Christianis Trajanum mitigat;</HI>  al. a. 102 <NOTE N="(22)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0062" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0062D"></COL> Vid. ejus epist. 98. l. X, conf. Pag. erit.
an. 102.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0062">109  <HI REND="ITALIC">Terraemotus multas urbes subvertit, et aurea
domus Neronis incendio perit, et Pantheum fulmine
concrematum.</HI>  Eus. a. 111.</P> <P COM="0062">111 Addit:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Qui quinto Nonas Maii martyrio coronatus
