saec. II, Bened.— <HI REND="ITALIC">Hildebertus rex Francorum obiit,
pro quo Dagobertus annis quinque.</HI></P> <P COM="0152">711  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinopoli . . . favens; unde et a Constantino
