 <NOTE N="(246)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="0156" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0156D"></COL> Hic incipit codex Gottwicensis minor ab
his verbis, quae in editis quoque leguntur:  <HI REND="ITALIC">Hucusque
regnum Romanorum, ex hinc Francorum supputatur,</HI> 
secundae scilicet stirpis.</NOTE> .</P> <P COM="0155"><HI REND="ITALIC">Carolus Pippini filius, cum jam principatum majoris
