Idem Pippinus, rex effectus,</HI>  XVII  <HI REND="ITALIC">annis regnavit.</HI></P> <P COM="0159"><COL N="0159D"></COL> 752  <HI REND="ITALIC">Auctoritate . . . Childerico Pippinus . . . unctus, regnavit
annis</HI>  XVII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Audogarius . . . incolere coepit</HI></P> <P COM="0159">753  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pippinus rex Saxoniam . . . occisus est. Stephanus
papa . . . reges unxit.</HI></P> <P COM="0159">754  <HI REND="ITALIC">S. Bonifacius Moguntinensis . . . Fresonibus praedicaret,
marturizatus est ab eis . . . annis</HI>  XXXII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Carlomanus . . .
 <COL N="0160C"></COL> Lugduni obiit. Pippinus Italiam cum exercitu
petens Haistulfum regem Papiae obsessum obsides dare,
et res S. Petri sub sacramento reddere coegit. Stephanus
. . rediit.</HI></P> <P COM="0160">755  <HI REND="ITALIC">Haistulphus . . . vastans; pro qua re papa legatos
per mare ad Pippinum pro auxilio misit.</HI></P> <P COM="0160"><COL N="0160D"></COL> 756  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pippinus . . . Papiae obsidet, et Ravennam aliasque
urbes pervasas eum S. Petro et domino papae per
legatum reddere compulit.</HI></P> <P COM="0160">757  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinus imp . . . misit.</HI></P> <P COM="0160">758  <HI REND="ITALIC">Romae . . . annis decem.</HI></P> <P COM="0160"><COL N="0161C"></COL> 759  <HI REND="ITALIC">Waifarius tyrannidem in Aquitania exercuit.
S. Othmarus . . . temerarie invasisset . . . ventris obiit,</HI>  etc.,
ut Aug.</P> <P COM="0161">760  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pippinus . . . invadit, et Waifarium injuste usurpata
